  "description": "LEPSEI crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group I 2 2 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C120 H104 Dy4 N16 O33 2+,2(Cl1 1-),7(H2 O1),3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1C (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.549-5.026 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.84-178.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L1)8(μ4-O)]·2Cl·3MeOH·7H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
